size 100 10
start
clipboard set s-clip
keys <Tab> x <CR>
keys p
frame a-frame
file todo.txt a-file
-- config.toml --
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
A +x
B +y
-- s-clip --
Buy +y
-- a-frame --
┌[3]─Projects─┐┌ [1]─+x ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│>+x       1/1││  1       A                                                           +x           │
│ +y       2/2││  2       Buy                                                         +y  filtered │
├[4]─Contexts─┤│                                                                                   │
│             ││                                                                                   │
├[5]─Filters──┤│                                                                                   │
│ [x] Done    ││                                                                                   │
│ [ ] Later   ││                                                                                   │
└─────────────┘└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  pasted 1 item; hidden by current filters in 2 seconds or at the next key
-- a-file --
A +x
2026-09-29 Buy +y
B +y
